    "name_raw": "Combat Reflexes",
    "definition_type_raw": "Combat",
    "source_book_raw": "PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 119",
    "definition_raw": "Source PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 119\nYou can make additional attacks of opportunity.\n\nBenefit: You may make a number of additional attacks of opportunity per round equal to your Dexterity bonus. With this feat, you may also make attacks of opportunity while flat-footed.\n\nNormal: A character without this feat can make only one attack of opportunity per round and can't make attacks of opportunity while flat-footed.\n\nSpecial: The Combat Reflexes feat does not allow a rogue to use her opportunist ability more than once per round.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "PRPG Core Rulebook pg. 119",
        "href_raw": "http://paizo.com/pathfinderRPG/v5748btpy88yj",
